{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233750","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233750","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1423375001:1":{"text":"唔哇，老师竟然把希娜带回来了，老师真厉害！","source_cn":"唔哇，老师竟然把希娜带回来了，老师真厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985987BFAEFF51D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423375002:1":{"text":"希娜，你不是说不来上课嘛，怎么现在又过来了？","source_cn":"希娜，你不是说不来上课嘛，怎么现在又过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x654F71D5A1E219B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423375003:1":{"text":"朱尔，你少说几句没人拿你当哑巴！","source_cn":"朱尔，你少说几句没人拿你当哑巴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DC8F016200C7169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423375004:1":{"text":"孩子们，安静啦，我们的大家庭人终于齐了，老师要正式开讲第一堂课了。","source_cn":"孩子们，安静啦，我们的大家庭人终于齐了，老师要正式开讲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05B47E566A959DD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423375005:1":{"text":"第一堂课的开头，老师想给你们讲一个故事。","source_cn":"第一堂课的开头，老师想给你们讲一个故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C562117C6B2F4DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_sta